// `is:inline`, so Astro emits them into the HTML instead of bundling them into a
// module: Search Console reads the raw <head> markup when verifying ownership via
// Google Analytics, and it matches the measurement ID only as a literal string —
// routing the ID through a variable makes verification fail.
//
// Neither identifier below is a secret. The GA4 measurement ID and the PostHog
// project token are both write-only, client-side values meant to ship in public HTML.
